    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Evil Boxes Are Back!!</strong></h2>``````````````````````````````<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/c89c4060d34ce501f02e38715a9b200f.poster.avif?t=1709638274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/c89c4060d34ce501f02e38715a9b200f.webm?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>```````````````````````````<br>Decipher The Riddles Given To You By Dad and Stomp The Right box Color; To Advance Through The Game.<br>Every Level Has a Unique Design That Corresponds With The Riddle You Are Given.<br>The Riddles Have To Be Solved Relatively Fast or The Evil Box Will Cause The Time To Loop Again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve The Mystery of The Time Looping Evil Boxes and Save Our Hero Aous In His Puzzling Adventure.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.poster.avif?t=1709638274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.webm?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.mp4?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Evil Boxes Are Back!!</strong></h2>``````````````````````````````<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/c89c4060d34ce501f02e38715a9b200f.poster.avif?t=1709638274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/c89c4060d34ce501f02e38715a9b200f.webm?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>```````````````````````````<br>Decipher The Riddles Given To You By Dad and Stomp The Right box Color; To Advance Through The Game.<br>Every Level Has a Unique Design That Corresponds With The Riddle You Are Given.<br>The Riddles Have To Be Solved Relatively Fast or The Evil Box Will Cause The Time To Loop Again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve The Mystery of The Time Looping Evil Boxes and Save Our Hero Aous In His Puzzling Adventure.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.poster.avif?t=1709638274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.webm?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261420/extras/bcfcf6677693751a16ec8a923f4b7d55.mp4?t=1709638274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
